    /// #### Panics
    /// * `'Fixed: overflow'` if the result does not fit the scalar range.
    /// #### Deviations
    /// * One shared `sin_cos`, then one fused kernel (`mul_sub` / `dot2`, one floor
    ///   rescale) per rotated component: each is within `1.02 * (|z| + |x|) + 1` ULP of
